orkflows in detail.\n\nHere's what I found:\n\n## Gustavo Santaolalla and The Last of Us Music\n\nThe music for The Last of Us Part II was composed by Gustavo Santaolalla, with additional music composed by Mac Quayle. However, I note that the search results reference \"Mac Quayle,\" not \"Mac Belinkie\" as mentioned in your query.\n\n## Composer Workflow for Interactive Game Music\n\nThe soundtracks come together over a period of two or three years, delivered in batches, and Neil Druckmann has said that certain parts of the music triggered him to write new scenes that he didn't have at the beginning, making it a much more artistic, collaborative effort.\n\nSantaolalla prefers to compose as he records, as he has little knowledge of reading and writing sheet music.\n\nFor The Last of Us Part II, recording sessions at PlayStation offices involved Gustavo, another composer, and a percussionist creating many grooves and textures by playing various percussion instruments and found objects, which were later chopped up and processed further for use in the game.\n\nIf you're looking for more specific information about Mac Belinkie or interactive game music workflows, you may need to clarify the search or provide additional details, as the results returned focused on Mac Quayle instead.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"2005697a-bbcc-45be-804d-6a9c897a745e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T00:08:10.271Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Gustavo Santaolalla Last of Us 2 Mac Belinkie composer workflow interactive game music","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_013XRjNRXpQE67kGYV9spz28","content":[{"title":"The AIAS Game Maker's Notebook: The Last of Us Series Composer, Gustavo Santaolalla","url":"https://interactive.libsyn.com/the-last-of-us-series-composer-gustavo-santaolalla"},{"title":"Music of The Last of Us - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_The_Last_of_Us"},{"title":"Behind the Additional Music of The Last of Us Part II","url":"https://composer.spitfireaudio.com/en/articles/behind-the-additional-music-of-the-last-of-us-part-ii"},{"title":"Inside the music of The Last of Us 2 with composer Gustavo Santaolalla | TechRadar","url":"https://www.techradar.com/news/inside-the-music-of-the-last-of-us-2-with-composer-gustavo-santaolalla"},{"title":"Music of The Last of Us Part II - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_The_Last_of_Us_Part_II"},{"title":"The overarching tone of this immersive experience 'The Last of Us 2' is set by composer Gustavo Santaolalla / techradar. | FrontView Magazine","url":"https://www.frontview-magazine.be/en/news/the-overarching-tone-of-this-immersive-experience-the-last-of-us-2-is-set-by-composer-gustavo-3"},{"title":"The Music of The Last of Us (Season 2) with Gustavo Santaolalla and David Fleming","url":"https://soundworkscollection.com/post/the-music-of-the-last-of-us-season-2-with-gustavo-santaolalla-and-david-fleming"}]},"Based on the search results, I found relevant information about Gustavo Santaolalla's work on The Last of Us series and how the music was created, though the results don't specifically mention Mac Belinkie or interactive game music workflows in detail.\n\nHere's what I found:\n\n## Gustavo Santaolalla and The Last of Us Music\n\nThe music for The Last of Us Part II was composed by Gustavo Santaolalla, with additional music composed by Mac Quayle. However, I note that the search results reference \"Mac Quayle,\" not \"Mac Belinkie\" as mentioned in your query.\n\n## Composer Workflow for Interactive Game Music\n\nThe soundtracks come together over a period of two or three years, delivered in batches, and Neil Druckmann has said that certain parts of the music triggered him to write new scenes that he didn't have at the beginning, making it a much more artistic, collaborative effort.\n\nSantaolalla prefers to compose as he records, as he has little knowledge of reading and writing s